rrect answer is very likely the second one.","tags":["#clippings"]},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[[55,60],[64,87]]},"smart_blocks:resrc/clippings/How Hard Is It To Open a File.md#---frontmatter---": {"path":null,"last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{},"text":null,"length":0,"last_read":{"hash":"1g6z3ry","at":1778505719382},"key":"resrc/clippings/How Hard Is It To Open a File.md#---frontmatter---","lines":[1,11],"size":663,"outlinks":[{"title":"Sebastian Wick","target":"Sebastian Wick","line":5}],"class_name":"SmartBlock"},
